The Blue Only Arrives in the Fire — Blue-and-White Porcelain — Lemo-Opuscar · LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5

Picture
- Every vessel (lathe meshes), brush stroke, wash, calligraphy stroke, glaze shader, crackle, kiln, shard, brush and plaque is drawn in code (demo/engine/*.js, demo/film.js). No generated or stock images, no photographs, no footage.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1; subset via the Google Fonts API into demo/fonts/)
- Cormorant Garamond (600, italic 500) — Christian Thalmann / Catharsis Fonts: Latin subtitle plaques

Voice
- None (no voice-over).

Music
- Original composition, synthesised in numpy (demo/mix.py): Karplus-Strong guqin and pipa, additive bamboo flute, frame drum and struck bowl. No samples.

Sound design
- All foley (brush, wheel, iris, kiln roar and ticks, shards, glaze taps, drip, birds) and room tone synthesised in numpy (demo/mix.py).

Facts shown on screen: see demo/FACTS.md (sources and wording).
